|               | (4) simplification          | 1,796        | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                             |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering                | 1,818        | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
